{# Jinja2 template for Markdown incident reports.
   Rendered by app/reporting/report_generator.py. `incident.investigation`
   is only set for incidents that met settings.investigation_min_confidence
   (see LogAnalysisPipeline._assemble_incidents) -- every AI-generated
   section below degrades to an explicit note when it's None, rather than
   silently omitting the heading. #}
# Incident Report: {{ incident.title }}

- **Incident ID:** {{ incident.incident_id }}
- **Severity:** {{ incident.severity.value }}
- **Generated:** {{ generated_at }}
{% if incident.investigation %}
- **Confidence Level:** {{ incident.investigation.confidence_level.value }}
{% endif %}

## Executive Summary

{% if incident.investigation %}
{{ incident.investigation.executive_summary }}
{% else %}
_No AI-generated executive summary is available for this incident (the LLM was unavailable or did not
return a valid response when this report was generated)._
{% endif %}

## Incident Summary

{% if incident.investigation %}
{{ incident.investigation.incident_summary }}
{% else %}
{{ incident.title }} was detected across {{ incident.correlated_events | length }} correlated
event group(s) and {{ incident.failure_patterns | length }} repeated failure pattern(s).
{% endif %}

## Major Issues Detected

{% for pattern in incident.failure_patterns %}
### {{ pattern.description }}

- Occurrences: {{ pattern.occurrences }}
- First seen: {{ pattern.first_seen }}
- Last seen: {{ pattern.last_seen }}
- Affected sources: {{ pattern.affected_sources | join(", ") }}
{% else %}
_No repeated failure patterns attached to this incident._
{% endfor %}
{% for group in incident.correlated_events %}
### Correlation group `{{ group.correlation_id }}`

- Components: {{ group.involved_components | join(", ") }}
- Hosts: {{ group.involved_hosts | join(", ") }}
- Window: {{ group.start_time }} -> {{ group.end_time }}
- Confidence: {{ "%.2f" | format(group.confidence_score) }}
{% endfor %}

## Timeline of Important Events

{% for event in incident.timeline %}
- **{{ event.timestamp }}** [{{ event.event_type.value }}] {{ event.title }} -- {{ event.description }}
{% else %}
_No curated timeline events are associated with this incident._
{% endfor %}

## Root Cause Analysis

{% if incident.investigation and incident.investigation.possible_root_causes %}
{% for cause in incident.investigation.possible_root_causes %}
### ({{ cause.likelihood.value }} likelihood) {{ cause.description }}

{% for evidence in cause.supporting_evidence %}
- {{ evidence }}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}

**How this conclusion was reached:** {{ incident.investigation.ai_reasoning or "Not provided by the LLM." }}
{% if incident.investigation.open_questions %}

**Open questions:**
{% for question in incident.investigation.open_questions %}
- {{ question }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% else %}
_No AI-generated root cause analysis is available for this incident._
{% endif %}

## Supporting Evidence

{% if incident.investigation and incident.investigation.supporting_evidence %}
{% for evidence in incident.investigation.supporting_evidence %}
- {{ evidence }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
_No LLM-curated supporting evidence is available; see Major Issues Detected above for the raw
deterministic evidence extracted from the current logs._
{% endif %}

## Similar Historical Incidents

{% for retrieved in incident.similar_incidents %}
- **{{ retrieved.incident.title }}** (similarity: {{ "%.2f" | format(retrieved.similarity_score) }})
  {{ retrieved.incident.summary }}
{% else %}
_No similar historical incidents were retrieved._
{% endfor %}
{% if incident.investigation and incident.investigation.similar_historical_incidents %}

LLM-cited historical incidents (attributed precedent, not current fact):
{% for ref in incident.investigation.similar_historical_incidents %}
- {{ ref.incident_id }}: {{ ref.title }} -- {{ ref.relevance_explanation }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

## Recommended Fixes

{% if incident.investigation and incident.investigation.recommended_actions %}
{% for action in incident.investigation.recommended_actions %}
- {{ action }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
_No AI-generated recommendations are available for this incident._
{% endif %}

## Confidence Level

{% if incident.investigation %}
**{{ incident.investigation.confidence_level.value }}**
{% if not incident.investigation.evidence_sufficient %}

_The model judged current log evidence insufficient for a fully confident conclusion._
{% endif %}
{% else %}
_Not assessed by the LLM for this incident._
{% endif %}
